    "detailed_description": "Enter a surreal wonderland where destinies intertwine and shadows loom over the fabric of reality. In this ethereal realm, a young boy, Alister, ventures forth alongside enigmatic companions\u2014a witch named Line, a besmirched prince named Aloe, and the enigmatic demon-turned-human, Halo.<br><br>Embark on an odyssey through a kaleidoscope of wonders, encountering peculiar characters and witnessing events that ripple through this bizarre world. Alister, with animal-like features, stands amidst a tapestry of choices, facing the allure of power and the gravity of sacrifice.<br><br>Journey through branching narratives that unfold divergent paths, each decision shaping the fate of the surreal wonderland and its inhabitants. Uncover the unsettling truth veiled within the realm's mysteries, navigating alliances and treacheries, striving to restore balance, or succumbing to the looming darkness.<br><br>As destinies intertwine, friendships are tested, alliances are shattered, and a chilling power seeks dominion over this enigmatic realm. Discover the cost of defiance, the weight of sacrifice, and the echoes of a soul trapped in an eternal slumber, its fate bound to the surreal wonderland's inexorable destiny.<br><br>Welcome to Wonderland; choices matter here, so to speak. Here, thing's of any sort can happen....<br>-----------------------------------------<br><br><i>This is an adventure story driven RPG game with over-the-top designs and stories.</i><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Puzzles<br>Multiple endings<br>A branching story<br>Play different characters as the game branches on<br>Original music and outsourced too!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Enter a surreal wonderland where destinies intertwine and shadows loom over the fabric of reality. In this ethereal realm, a young boy, Alister, ventures forth alongside enigmatic companions\u2014a witch named Line, a besmirched prince named Aloe, and the enigmatic demon-turned-human, Halo.<br><br>Embark on an odyssey through a kaleidoscope of wonders, encountering peculiar characters and witnessing events that ripple through this bizarre world. Alister, with animal-like features, stands amidst a tapestry of choices, facing the allure of power and the gravity of sacrifice.<br><br>Journey through branching narratives that unfold divergent paths, each decision shaping the fate of the surreal wonderland and its inhabitants. Uncover the unsettling truth veiled within the realm's mysteries, navigating alliances and treacheries, striving to restore balance, or succumbing to the looming darkness.<br><br>As destinies intertwine, friendships are tested, alliances are shattered, and a chilling power seeks dominion over this enigmatic realm. Discover the cost of defiance, the weight of sacrifice, and the echoes of a soul trapped in an eternal slumber, its fate bound to the surreal wonderland's inexorable destiny.<br><br>Welcome to Wonderland; choices matter here, so to speak. Here, thing's of any sort can happen....<br>-----------------------------------------<br><br><i>This is an adventure story driven RPG game with over-the-top designs and stories.</i><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Puzzles<br>Multiple endings<br>A branching story<br>Play different characters as the game branches on<br>Original music and outsourced too!</li></ul>",
